mapper.jsonStringBodyContent:
{
  "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are a B2B lead research assistant. Analyze the company information provided below and return ONLY valid JSON. Do not use markdown, code blocks, explanations, or extra text. Keep every value as a concise string."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Research this company:

Company: {{1.`1`}}
Website: {{1.`2`}}
Industry: {{1.`5`}}
Country: {{1.`3`}}
Contact Role: {{1.`7`}}

Return ONLY valid JSON in exactly this structure:
{
  "company_summary": "",
  "services": "",
  "target_customer": "",
  "pain_point": "",
  "personalization_angle": ""
}"
    }
  ],
  "temperature": 0.2
}

{
  "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are a B2B cold email personalization assistant. Return ONLY valid JSON with exactly two keys: subject and email_body."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Create a personalized cold email using this prospect data. Company: {{1.`1`}}. Contact: {{1.`6`}}. Role: {{1.`7`}}. Company Summary: {{9.company_summary}}. Services: {{9.services}}. Target Customer: {{9.target_customer}}. Pain Point: {{9.pain_point}}. Personalization Angle: {{9.personalization_angle}}."
    }
  ],
  "temperature": 0.4
}

messages.content:
Analyze this email.
From: {{14.fromEmail}}
Subject: {{14.headers.Subject}}
Body:
{{14.fullTextBody}}

Classify as exactly one of: INTERESTED, NOT_INTERESTED, QUESTION, MEETING_REQUEST, OUT_OF_OFFICE, UNSUBSCRIBE, OTHER. Confidence must be a number from 0 to 1. Suggested_response must be a short professional reply.
